{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22478","headline":"遣怀 · 白居易","name":"遣怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐往必悲生，泰来由否极。\n谁言此数然，吾道何终塞。\n尝求詹尹卜，拂龟竟默默。\n亦曾仰问天，天但苍苍色。\n自兹唯委命，名利心双息。\n近日转安闲，乡园亦休忆。\n回看世间苦，苦在求不得。\n我今无所求，庶离忧悲域。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}